<title>SINGAPORE: Singapore economy grows 3.8 pct in first quarter.</title>
<headline>Singapore economy grows 3.8 pct in first quarter.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-05-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Singapore economy grew 3.8 percent in the first quarter of 1997, the Ministry of Trade and Industry said on Friday.  </p>
<p>Table of Singapore's GDP growth</p>
<p>(percentage change over same period a year ago)</p>
<p>					'97    '96    '96    '96</p>
<p>					 Q1     Q4     Q1     FY</p>
<p>    Total (pct)		   3.8    5.8    11.5   7.0</p>
<p>    Manufacturing		-6.7   -0.7    13.6   3.4</p>
<p>    Construction		 10.7   13.7    26.9  18.4</p>
<p>    Commerce			3.0    5.4    10.4   6.0</p>
<p>Transport/communications	7.6    7.6    10.7   8.1</p>
<p>Financial/business svcs	10.5   10.0     9.1   8.2</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65) 870-3497</p>
</text>
